<h2 class="font-title-lg text-title-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">Request Expired · Auto-Escalated</h2>
</div>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 leading-snug">
        Request expired. It was offered to the next hospital:
        <span class="font-bold text-on-surface">Sunrise Heart &amp; Critical Care</span>
<span class="text-tertiary font-medium">(8 min away)</span>.
      </p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-space-xs mt-space-xs text-tertiary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">sync_saved_locally</span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md">Escalated at 10:44:18 · Ambulance rerouted</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
