<div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface font-bold">Sunrise Heart &amp; Critical Care</p>
<p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant">ER Gate 2 (Emergency Ambulance Ramp, South Wing)</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
